abstract = {Special-purpose computational hardware, in integer and floating-point arithmetic units, as well as in memory systems, provides opportunities to accelerate a wide range of mathematical applications, including medical imaging, digital signal processing, artificial intelligence, and cryptography.In this workshop, university and IBM speakers provided insight into a selection of novel uses of computer system design to accelerate important applications.},
